    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mousse",
        "text": "...Haze, Haze!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_185_frncat_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Meow?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mint",
        "text": "You're okay, right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Mmn... Was I off saying things again just now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_185_frncat_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mousse",
        "text": "You suddenly ducked down muttering something, and then you wouldn't say anything at all, like you'd fallen fast asleep."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_185_frncat_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "My, my, this hat is incorrigible, scaring people by raving lunatic and arcane. It does ab\u2014solutely nothing to fit my style."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mint",
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit said that when Operators display this sort of loss of self-conscious response, we have to report it to Medical straight away..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Oh, I'm fine, I'm fine meow. I wouldn't be caught dead on those bloody infirmary beds. The kitties by my feet are just too adorable, and I couldn't help losing myself in loving them."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mint",
        "text": "Haha. There's always so many kitties around Mousse, that's why."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "And what a mewtiful thing! For absolute kitty-addicts like me, Mousse becomes an indispensable part of life..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_185_frncat_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mousse",
        "text": "Heheh, they're all so kind. That's why they've been protecting me since I was back in Victoria..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_185_frncat_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_185_frncat_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mousse",
        "text": "...Haze?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mousse",
        "text": "(She's in another daze...)"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mousse",
        "text": "Haze?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
