            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mint",
        "text": "...Miss Haze!"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.1
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 0.5,
            "xstrength": 15,
            "ystrength": 15,
            "vibration": 20,
            "randomness": 70,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.2
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Myah! ...I'm\u2014I'm alright."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mint",
        "text": "What's weighing on your mind, Haze? You've been paying extra attention to our surroundings since a bit ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mint",
        "text": "(Whisper) C\u2014Could it be a scent? Has something dangerous sneaked into the Rhodes Island base?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "It's not, I just... happened to notice woman of distinction passing by."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mint",
        "text": "Woman of...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_185_frncat_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mousse",
        "text": "Distinction...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mousse",
        "text": "Ah! You mean Miss.Christine? I didn't detect her at all."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_185_frncat_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "It's clear to see while all the kitties around gather in the plaza to bask and frolic, Miss.Christine doesn't seem one bit taken by it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mint",
        "text": "Miss.Christine is a very self-determining kind of kitty. She prefers quiet, lonely places."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mint",
        "text": "Now that we mention it, that sounds familiar. You usually love playing about with us, but in front of Miss.Christine, you turn all quiet."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Because... there's a deep, very familiar sense of respect living in Miss.Christine. I can't help it when I gaze at her."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_130",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Miss.Christine",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_185_frncat_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mousse",
        "text": "Could it be, you've met Miss.Christine before, Haze?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_185_frncat_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "How could an escapee like me hope to know a kitty of her status? No, it's\u2014her manner, graceful, unhurried, self-pleasing. Not one bit unlike some 'benefactors' who aided me in the past."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mint",
        "text": "Are you talking about..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Well, well... a bygone tale already, is it... myah-hah-hah, this hat's off on its crazed ramblings again. Steals away my attention without notice if I'm not careful."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Mm! Mousse, Mint, treat all of that jabber as my joke!"
    },
    {
        "command": "stopmusic",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 1
        }
    },
    {
