        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "But I know there's no joke here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "To anyone else, a fugitive like me is just as good dead or alive... some might even curse me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Society has the type who find joy in evaluating other people's worth. Being bullied by them is far from new for me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "It was harder than you'd believe to escape that prison... my sickness hit me worse and worse."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "But in catching this nuisance of a disease, I caught an absurd, hitherto unpossessed hope too, the capacity to put my Originium Arts to full use..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "With the catch that at first, it did absolutely no good."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Once they all saw the cuts only an Infected could have, even the nicest baker's lady wouldn't pass a crumb of old bread onto me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "I had a mind to use the power of my Arts to strike up terror in those shopkeepers' hearts... but then it slipped far out of my control, and blew straight through an entire neighborhood's worth of houses."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "That kind of barbarous strength could never take me back to my normal life in Victoria. I understood that inside and out."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "But, well, you know horrid 'nuisances' like me could be dead or alive to anyone else..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "If even my own self turns a blind eye to my life, what other need is there to be alive?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "However\u2014I wouldn't like to die."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "I spent such a tremendous amount of effort to escape that prison by the skin of my teeth, and yet I found not one person in the whole of Victoria who had any concern left for me, any willingness to accept me..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Not even... a sliver of charity to give."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Look at me, in that state. Imagine if I'd never met 'it.' If I'd never met 'them.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "I was near to forgetting why I bothered with my escape in the first place."
    },
    {
