    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "My, have mew been standing here for long, Doctor?"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "You taking a stroll just like the 'kitties'?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Hah-hah. I'm shirking exactly nothing. It's a break between shifts right now, and my stroll has the right to go anywhere it wants."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Doctor, did you know? When you care too much about something, it's all too easy to let the important things slip you by."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "This pen from your pocket, for example. Could I have the honor of using it for a day?"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Agh! Here we go again.",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Let me say upfront: I'm not trying to hide anything under the covers here. I'm just plainly, simply greeting you face-to-face. Right, plain and simple."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_130"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Miss.Christine",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.7
    },
    {
        "command": "characteraction",
        "params": {
            "name": "middle",
            "type": "move",
            "x": 300,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 0.5
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Ah. See, Miss.Christine's noticed your scent too. She's taken an even higher-up ceiling strut to rest on."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Meow? Yes, that's right, I was staring at Miss.Christine a moment ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "I just stopped in my tracks to admire her. Observing from beyond, at a distance that won't put her on alert. Up until you passed by, Miss.Christine and I were getting along like a house on fire."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Hm? Why don't I try chit-chatting with Miss.Christine, is it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "There once was a kitty with quite a resemblance to Miss.Christine who, back in my Victorian days in hiding, came to my help."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Gave me food to eat, offered me clothes to huddle in, led me to dingy little alleyways and warehouses where I could hide from the hunt for me..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "After some time, when I'd finally learned a little Arts, I wanted to find that kitty again. Repay it, you know."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "I'd gotten such splendid food in comparison, such warm clothes I'd pilfered to offer it, and all it ended in was my forsaken, lonely exit from the streets."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "*sigh*... Doctor, why is a raven like a writing desk? Why must we meet at three in the afternoon? Why do perfectly decent people take the fall for the awful, and why does misfortune prey on good people?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Why... am I unable to live as a kitty does?"
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Haze...;My unjust past isn't your fault.",
            "values": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Hah-hah... meow unbecoming of me, Doctor."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "That certainly wasn't Haze grumbling to you. If you were just subject to someone rattling strange things off at you, it's alright now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "That moody, depressing little scamp. I choked the life out of it myself only a meowment ago."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "If I\u2014If Haze loved whining so much, then she would've looooo\u2014ong, long ago crumbled under the weight."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "But she\u2014I've been through everything, followed my heart for everything, came to Rhodes Island holding my faith in myself dear."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "That's quite the extraordinary feat to pull off, isn't it? Myah-hah-hah."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Well, then, have your pen back. *yawn*\u2014It's about time I find a nice spot to sway my tail and have a nice sleep..."
    },
    {
        "command": "camerashake",
        "params": {
            "duration": 1,
            "xstrength": 50,
            "ystrength": 50,
            "vibration": 30,
            "randomness": 90,
            "fadeout": true,
            "block": false
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Mreow? Yaah\u2014!"
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$bodyfalldown1",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "fadetime": 0.8,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.5
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "...H-Haze?",
            "values": "1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "playsound",
        "params": {
            "key": "$rungeneral",
            "volume": 0.6
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_185_frncat_1",
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mousse",
        "text": "Ah! I found Haze!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_388_mint_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mint",
        "text": "Haze, are you okay?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Oh, it was just a trifle. Simply wasn't looking and fell right down. No need to worry, Mint, Mousse, Doctor."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_185_frncat_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mousse",
        "text": "Knew it\u2014you love running off to hide every time there's a health checkup. The Medic Operators tasked us to take you with us to the consultation room, or bust!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_185_frncat_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Tsk... it's so cruel to make me stare down the state of my own health."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mint",
        "text": "Haze?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "No, it's alright. I suppose it's good of Rhodes Island's doctors to keep some form of privacy. Let's take a siesta for a while first, before we visit that dreadful, disinfectant-stinking room."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mint",
        "text": "Bu\u2014But you almost fainted a moment ago..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_388_mint_1#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Look at that, I have Mint and Mousse with me too. You won't be one bit late carrying me over after I faint for real."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "And the Doctor's right here as well."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_185_frncat_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mousse",
        "text": "No\u2014can\u2014do\u2014! Health maintenance is incredibly important! Um, though we don't really qualify as 'healthy' people..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_185_frncat_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Leave the meat of the lecture until after we find those adorable little kitties, and have ourselves a proper group lie-down. Mousse, where have those kits gone to rest today?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1",
            "name2": "char_185_frncat_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mousse",
        "text": "Hm? I-If I had to guess, probably in the Garden..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Then time's of the essence. Let's convene the kitties right now and tour around the Garden together!"
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.3
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_141_nights_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 0.3
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Ah, Doctor, you're still here."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "As you can see, I'll be taking a nice, lazy afternoon nap, getting a pre-departure physical exam done and dusted, and then I'll report in with my team, and we'll start today's acts of 'chivalry.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Coming from a former thief and a criminal on the run, it might be quite ironic to hear."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "But, Doctor, as far as I'm concerned now, this is quite nice."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "As things stand, my strange little self somehow has battles to fight for the sake of saving others, and thus the chance to be approved of by more and more people..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Doctor, you're not like those once-adorable twice-adored kits, and versus one of refined manners and a concern only for her own freedom like Miss.Christine, you're a world apart."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "I just can't make heads or tails of you... but I know that here and now, you're partial to frolicking about with me, and willing to entrust missions to me with proud and confident airs."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "If you ask me, having earned that much from you makes me absolutely content."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Myah-hah-hah, that's what you wanted to say, wasn't it, you lunatic little hat? So long, meow revoir!"
    },
