    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Yes, rather than my 'liking' kitties, it might be better to say I revere them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Or, perhaps... envy them."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "It's an envy which, at some times, compounds my frustrations."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "Ah, humanity... always this way. Any one of its desires coming about can carry unforeseeable dangers. Pay a shred of attention less, and you'll cause yourself to fall into the straits of distress."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "That said... never anticipate a kitty's actions based on your own dear wishes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "They're kitties. Free, merry, lucky, ill-omened, saddened kitties."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "What's more important is they do as they please, come and go unfettered, with none of those complicated human social devotions. They simply enjoy life, full stop\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Haze",
        "text": "After all, what could people ever hope to demand from a kitty?"
    },
